  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Nordic Development Fund (NDF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Nordic Development Fund (NDF) is to advance Nordic leadership in addressing development challenges through financing, knowledge and partnerships. This will be done with strategic partners, with whom NDF will develop, launch and scale high-impact projects to support developing countries and the most vulnerable people.</narrative>
  </description>
